              "text": "Pages 6\u201310: A New Family & Belonging\n\nTrey is invited into a new home.\n\nYour child may feel:\n\u2022 Excited\n\u2022 Nervous\n\u2022 Unsure\n\nWhat to say:\n\u201cNew things can feel exciting and scary.\u201d\n\u201cIt\u2019s okay to take time to feel safe.\u201d\n\u201cFamilies grow together.\u201d",
