              "id": "overlay-companion-21",
              "text": "Supporting Your Child\n\nHelpful responses:\n\u201cI\u2019m here with you.\u201d\n\u201cThat makes sense.\u201d\n\u201cYou\u2019re safe.\u201d\n\u201cYou can always talk to me.\u201d\n\nTry to avoid:\n\u201cDon\u2019t be sad\u201d\n\u201cYou\u2019re fine\u201d\n\u201cBe strong\u201d\n\nClosing Message\n\nLove can grow again, even after loss.\n\nWith your presence, your child can learn they are safe, cared for, and not alone.",
